# CHANGELOG

## [0.8.0] - 2026-09-28

- `.gitignore`:
  - Created repository ignore filters for TLS private keys and certs (`*.key`, `*.pem`, `*.crt`), database files (`data/*.db*`), large model weights (`models/**/*.gguf`), Android build caches (`app/build/`, `.gradle/`), IDE configs, and screen captures.
- `brainuke_core/cognition/llama_client.py`:
  - Added missing `Any` import from `typing`.
- `TODO.txt`:
  - Added security audit findings for zero-touch pairing authentication, self-healing authorization gates, hostname verification, and CA server access.

## [0.7.0] - 2026-09-27

- `brainuke_extension/app/src/main/res/` & `AndroidManifest.xml`:
  - Generated full Android app launcher icon suite from `data/Cecilia_01_ico.ico`:
    - Standard density icons (`ic_launcher.png`) across `mipmap-mdpi` (48x48), `mipmap-hdpi` (72x72), `mipmap-xhdpi` (96x96), `mipmap-xxhdpi` (144x144), and `mipmap-xxxhdpi` (192x192).
    - Circular masked icons (`ic_launcher_round.png`) across all densities for rounded OEM launchers.
    - Adaptive icon foreground layers (`ic_launcher_foreground.png`) framed within the 72dp safe zone.
    - Adaptive icon XML definitions (`ic_launcher.xml` and `ic_launcher_round.xml`) under `mipmap-anydpi-v26` paired with emerald dark theme background (`#1A4335`).
  - Linked `android:icon="@mipmap/ic_launcher"` and `android:roundIcon="@mipmap/ic_launcher_round"` to `<application>` and `<activity android:name=".MainActivity">`.
  - Verified resource compilation via Gradle `processDebugResources`.

- `brainuke_core/memory/vault.py`:
  - Updated default Android companion influence weight from 0.7 to 0.35 (Tether).
  - Executed database scrub on `data/brainuke_master.db`: purged 49 repeated offline status pings, removed degenerate token loop insight, scrubbed test/filler dialogues, and inserted 3 canonical DMN refined insights (`#ARCHITECTURE`, `#TACTICAL_ANALYSIS`, `#SENSORY`).
- `brainuke_throne/server/main.py`:
  - Updated `POST /api/v1/sync/push` companion ingest weight to 0.35.
  - Updated `GET /api/v1/history` weight metadata to `pc_master: 1.0`, `android_companion: 0.35`, `telemetry_oracle: 0.2`.
- `brainuke_throne/ui_desktop/cecilia_ui.py`:
  - Updated stage tab bar priority badge: `👑 PC Core (Weight 1.0) ≫ 📱 Android (Weight 0.35)`.
  - Updated filter pill label from `📱 Android (0.7)` to `📱 Android (0.35)`.
  - Updated history feed formatter to support 2-decimal weight display (`0.35`).
  - Updated diagnostics card text to reflect PC Core Master (1.0) > Droid (0.35).
- `brainuke_core/cognition/llama_client.py`:
  - Added `repeat_penalty: 1.15` and `repeat_last_n: 64` to `generate_text` payload.
  - Added `"<|channel>"` stop token to `DEFAULT_STOP`.
- `brainuke_core/cognition/deep_cook.py`:
  - Structured DMN distillation prompt using official Gemma 4 chat templating.
  - Added `_sanitize_insight` to detect and strip degenerate repetition loops and leaked channel tags.
- `brainuke_core/cognition/simmer_bus.py`:
  - Suppressed archiving `[PC Core Offline]` error notices as distilled memory insights; falls back to deterministic summary.
  - Added deduplication gate to prevent archiving identical consecutive insights.
- `tests/test_ui_history.py` & `tests/test_sync_and_weighting.py`:
  - Updated test assertions for 0.35 companion influence weight and telemetry oracle weighting.
- `weird output.txt`:
  - Replaced corrupted/repetitive log with distilled high-density stream and DMN insights.

## [Unreleased] - 2026-09-26

- `brainuke_throne/ui_desktop/cecilia_ui.py`:
  - Added dual-stage deck navigation with `💬 Live Cognitive Stage` and `📜 Memory & DMN History` tabs.
  - Implemented History Tab showing chronological memory feed of interaction dialogues and DMN refined insights.
  - Enforced prominent visual hierarchy: PC Cecilia turns tagged with `[👑 PC CORE MASTER • WEIGHT 1.0 (CANON)]` and Android companion turns tagged with `[📱 ANDROID COMPANION • WEIGHT 0.7]`.
  - Displayed DMN refined insights tagged with `[⚡ DMN REFINED INSIGHT]` detailing concept family, importance weight, dominance weight, and world delta summary.
  - Added filter pills (`All Records`, `👑 PC Master (1.0)`, `📱 Android (0.7)`, `⚡ DMN Refined`), item count badge, refresh button, and automated background refresh on tab switch, interact completion, DMN simmer ack, and sync alignment.
- `brainuke_throne/server/main.py`:
  - Added `GET /api/v1/history` endpoint with machine token authentication, supporting `limit` and `filter` (`all`, `pc`, `android`, `dmn`) query parameters, returning combined interactions and DMN insights along with master/companion influence weights (`pc_master: 1.0`, `android_companion: 0.7`).
- `brainuke_core/memory/vault.py`:
  - Added optional `source_device` filtering parameter to `get_recent_interactions()`.
  - Added `get_distilled_insights()` helper method.
- `tests/test_ui_history.py` & `tests/test_sync_and_weighting.py`:
  - Added unit test coverage for History tab stage switching, feed rendering, weighting badges, DMN refined tag formatting, and `GET /api/v1/history` endpoint filters.

- `brainuke_throne/ui_desktop/cecilia_ui.py`:
  - Renamed sidebar card title from `DISCUSSION THREADS` to `MESSAGEBOARD`.
  - Added token diversion in `_append_speech_chunk` intercepting any `[DECONSTRUCTION]`, `[MOTIVE]`, `[SUBTEXT]`, etc., chunks and routing them to the collapsible thought drawer.
  - Enhanced `_finalize_streaming_turn` with `ThoughtIsolation().isolate()` to enforce zero deconstruction leakage in speech bubbles.
  - Increased cognitive interaction timeout to 120s and added `interact_error` event handling to reset `is_streaming` state cleanly upon read timeout.
- `brainuke_core/cognition/orchestrator.py`:
  - Fixed thought closing tag from `<|thought|>` to `</|thought|>` in Phase 3 prompt, eliminating prompt confusion that caused model to emit deconstruction in speech mode.
  - Capped Phase 2 reasoning `n_predict=512` to eliminate latency timeouts.
  - Added in-flight thought detection during Phase 3 streaming to divert reasoning tokens to `on_thought_chunk`.
  - Added auto-synthesis fallback if model outputs pure deconstruction.
- `brainuke_core/cognition/thought_isolation.py`:
  - Enhanced `ThoughtIsolation` to isolate multi-paragraph reasoning sections, analytical headers, and bullet points while preserving authentic spoken dialogue.
- `tests/test_sync_and_weighting.py` & `tests/test_thought_isolation.py`:
  - Updated test assertions for `</|thought|>` closing tag and added unit test coverage for multi-paragraph deconstruction isolation.

- `brainuke_throne/server/main.py`:
  - Decoupled `POST /api/v1/sync/trigger` and `POST /api/v1/sync/simmer` into non-blocking background tasks, eliminating HTTP client read timeouts caused by heavy LLM distillation on port 8081.
  - Implemented live `status` tracking (`in_progress` vs `idle`) in `last_sync_info`, broadcasting `sync_update` and `dmn_status` over SSE Downlink.
  - Added `sync_status`, `is_simmering`, and `last_simmer` fields to `/api/v1/cognitive/status` and `/api/v1/sync/status`.
- `brainuke_core/cognition/simmer_bus.py`:
  - Added `status_fn` async callback to emit `dmn_status` (`simmering` vs `idle`) and tracked `last_simmer_time`.
- `brainuke_core/cognition/deep_cook.py`:
  - Capped distillation LLM calls to `n_predict=256` to accelerate DMN synthesis from ~40s to ~3-5s.
- `brainuke_throne/ui_desktop/cecilia_ui.py`:
  - Implemented dynamic "In Progress" vs "Finished" states for both Sync and DMN Simmer:
    - Syncing: Top label displays `Syncing in progress... ⏳` and sidebar shows `• Last Sync: In progress... ⏳` (gold), with `🔄 Sync` disabled.
    - Synced: Labels transition to `Last Sync: HH:MM:SS` (mint green) and button re-enables.
    - Simmering: Sidebar shows `• DMN Simmer: Simmering... ⏳` (gold) and `⚡ Simmer DMN` disables to `⚡ Simmering...`.
    - Simmered: Shows `• DMN Simmer: Idle (Last: HH:MM:SS)` and button re-enables.
  - Increased HTTP client timeouts for sync and simmer to 60s as a secondary safeguard.
- `tests/test_sync_and_weighting.py`:
  - Added unit test coverage for async non-blocking simmer and trigger in-progress states.

- `brainuke_core/cognition/llama_client.py`:
  - Increased `n_predict` default from 256/160 to 2048 in `generate_text` and `generate_stream`, eliminating abrupt conversational cutoffs.
  - Updated `DEFAULT_STOP` to `["<turn|>", "<end_of_turn>", "<|turn>user", "<|turn>system", "<eos>", "<|end|>"]`.
- `brainuke_core/cognition/thought_isolation.py`:
