### Fixed
- `brainuke_extension/app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml`: Declared `<uses-native-library android:name="libOpenCL.so" android:required="false" />` along with `-car` and `-pixel` variants to permit `dlopen` access to vendor OpenCL drivers across Android 12+ namespace barriers.
- `brainuke_extension/app/build.gradle.kts`: Configured `packaging { jniLibs { useLegacyPackaging = true } }` ensuring uncompressed extraction of native `.so` binaries from APK to app native library directory.
- `brainuke_extension/app/src/main/jniLibs/arm64-v8a/libc++_shared.so`: Added missing C++ shared runtime library required for dynamic linking by `libserenity_llama.so`.
- `brainuke_extension/app/src/main/java/com/example/serenitydroid/jni/LlamaAndroid.kt`: Explicitly pre-loaded runtime dependencies (`c++_shared` and `omp`) before loading `serenity_llama`; exposed `isLibraryLoaded` state check.
- `brainuke_extension/app/src/main/java/com/brainuke/serenitydroid/inference/LocalInferenceEngine.kt`:
  - Verified `LlamaAndroid.isLibraryLoaded` and native loader return codes before setting `ModelLoadState.Loaded`.
  - Updated `backendHint = "OpenCL"` in native model loader preventing fallback to CPU mode tracking in `libserenity_llama.so`.
  - Refined token stopping and scrubbing logic with separate `endPattern` (breaks generation on true EOG/EOS) and `controlPattern` (strips `</?start_of_turn>`, `</?end_of_turn>`, and special tags without breaking stream).
  - Cleaned thought isolation logic in `ThoughtIsolator.isolate` to avoid echoing speech output into reasoning drawers when no `<thought>` tags are emitted.
- `brainuke_extension/app/src/main/java/com/brainuke/serenitydroid/inference/LocalInferenceEngine.kt`:
  - Upgraded prompt formatting to official Gemma 4 chat templating (`<bos><|turn>system\n<|think|>\n...<turn|>\n<|turn>user\n...<turn|>\n<|turn>model\n`), replacing incompatible Gemma 2 `<start_of_turn>` tokens that caused immediate EOG token emission on token 0.
  - Added `<turn|>` and `<|turn>` to `endPattern` and control sequence sanitization.
  - Added empty piece tolerance (up to 3 consecutive empty chunks) in completion loop preventing premature exit on special token consumption.
  - Bound native thought fallback to `LlamaAndroid.getBackendName()`.
- `brainuke_extension/app/src/main/java/com/brainuke/serenitydroid/util/ThoughtIsolator.kt`:
  - Added support for Gemma 4 native thinking channels (`<|channel>thought...<channel|>`) and `<|think|>` blocks in `thoughtBlockRegex`, `orphanStartTagRegex`, and `rawTagRegex`.
- `brainuke_extension/app/src/main/java/com/brainuke/serenitydroid/MainActivity.kt`:
  - Fixed horizontal action bar button overlap and text clipping with 16px right margins, padding, and rounded pill gradient drawables.
  - Added direct `updateModelStatusChip(newState)` callbacks during model selection and inference configuration updates so `modelStatusChip` immediately synchronizes to `🔮 Secret: Loaded` or `🟢 Normal: Loaded`.

### Security
- `brainuke_extension/app/src/main/res/xml/network_security_config.xml`: Hardened network security config by disabling global cleartext traffic, removing user certificate trust anchors, restricting cleartext HTTP strictly to loopback development interfaces (`10.0.2.2`, `127.0.0.1`, `localhost`), and enforcing custom Root CA pinning (`@raw/rootca`).

